WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.300
1886 — the first recorded XI

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.300
1954 — eleven timed goals

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.300
1968 — level at ninety, three in seven

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.300
1999 — the bench enters history

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.000
2008 — eleven marks decide it

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.600
1968 ↔ 2008 — the same summit

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:30.600
Both No. 7. Both scored. Both peaked.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.600
1999 — eleven days, no margin

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.600
Three must-wins. Every winner from the bench.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:01:00.000
Fergie time — the same late shape

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:06.000
671 goals after 85′

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.300
Old Trafford — 395 leads held

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.300
Only three needed rescuing

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.000
6,028 matches — pull a thread

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Every claim leads back to its receipt
